	)
	(gr_text "PROVISIONAL 3+2+3 HDI, 1.6 mm. 35/18 um Cu; 100 um build-up; 802 um core.\nFR4 Dk 4.2 assumed. Fab to confirm stack, impedance, finish and CSP lands.\nFilled/capped microvias. RF 50-ohm / USB 90-ohm geometry pending stackup."
